  "description": "“I am an Imugi training to become a dragon.”\n\nOn a sunny spring day, he found a snake in the mountains. He\nfelt sorry for the creature, which looked like it was about to die, so he simply raised it at home for a while. Then,\none day, the snake spoke. It\n\npromised to become a dragon and grant his wish if he shared some of his energy and helped it ascend to heaven, so\nhe agreed to live with it, dreaming of winning the lottery.\n\n“Wh-who are you?”\n“Who else could be here besides me?”\n\nThe man’s deep voice sounded strangely familiar.\nThe atmosphere he exuded also resembled something else.\nRather than a human, he was a monster—no, a demon, or perhaps a god.\n\n“An Imugi…?”\n“That’s right, it’s me.”\n\nSeungju never imagined this fellow would even be able to transform into a human.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**\n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002496)",
